          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma antwara nyakabuga bwatana aha kihigi ekya kasi, nakyo akipima. Kikaba kiganiraine n'ebihigi ebindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiyumba byakyo eby'omu rubaju n'efuremu zakyo, n'ekishasi kyakyo, bikaba biganiraine n'ebindi. Omunda obuzingora kikaba kinamu amadirisha; n'ekishasi kyakyo kikaba kina amadirisha. Oburai bwakyo bukaba buli bw'emita 25, kandi obukika kina buli bw'emita 12 1/2. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikaba kizingoirwe ebishasi eby'oburai obw'emita 12 1/2 n'obukika bw'emita 2 1/2. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekishasi kyakyo kikaba kilebire nyarubuga. Efuremu yakyo ekaba einaho emikindo, kandi kikaba kina amatembero munana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
